OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment defends No 10 North
OL,4,Aamid policing concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has defended Number 10
OL,7,FNorth after concerns were raised about
OL,8,Fthe cost of policing the prime
OL,9,Fminister's Manchester office.
OL,11,FGreater Manchester deputy mayor Kate
OL,12,FGreen said the office was placing
OL,13,F"significant additional demands" on the
OL,14,Fforce, which is facing a predicted
OL,15,Fbudget overspend of almost #10m this
OL,16,Fyear.
OL,18,FThe government said police force
OL,19,Ffunding was at a "historic high" and
OL,20,FGMP has had a #33.3m rise.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
